    "steam_appid": 3792920,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic fantasy adventure in Mythswayer, a turn-based rogue-lite where every run is a new challenge through magical tomes filled with danger, secrets, and powerful discoveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792920/extras/33859fe9c1acb06d20d3a795aa162fbf.poster.avif?t=1752675533\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792920/extras/33859fe9c1acb06d20d3a795aa162fbf.webm?t=1752675533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792920/extras/33859fe9c1acb06d20d3a795aa162fbf.mp4?t=1752675533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle foes based on a complex RPG-lite combat system where your progression choices, items, and strategy all matter. Be wary of your environment, as weather and the time of day also influence the threats you encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792920/extras/20b7cb2ba84ff7fee8367b51ea52d2db.poster.avif?t=1752675533\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792920/extras/20b7cb2ba84ff7fee8367b51ea52d2db.webm?t=1752675533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792920/extras/20b7cb2ba84ff7fee8367b51ea52d2db.mp4?t=1752675533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot your enemies and hidden treasures to acquire meaningful gear items, tomes, and potions of refreshment. Manage your character points and skills to create the hero you want to be in an almost classless progression system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792920/extras/bcc26632aa08f6620e30e3181663d793.poster.avif?t=1752675533\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792920/extras/bcc26632aa08f6620e30e3181663d793.webm?t=1752675533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792920/extras/bcc26632aa08f6620e30e3181663d793.mp4?t=1752675533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your Arcane Tome and magical inks to alter your environment and overcome obstacles, create cover, or trick your foes. Discover new \u201cIdeas\u201d that help you shape the very fabric of reality as you wade through ancient Myths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792920/extras/d1b5727c694b6740c9d8af8f2f8490a4.poster.avif?t=1752675533\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792920/extras/d1b5727c694b6740c9d8af8f2f8490a4.webm?t=1752675533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792920/extras/d1b5727c694b6740c9d8af8f2f8490a4.mp4?t=1752675533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a casual player looking for a fun challenge or a hardcore strategist craving depth, Mythswayer has something for you. If you love tactical combat, rogue-lite challenges, and high-fantasy adventures, get ready to inscribe your legend in Mythswayer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please help us get funded! We need as many wishlists as possible to ensure the future of the game! Many thanks for your support in advance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792920/extras/159a6128c814184e551919c7b15efebe.poster.avif?t=1752675533\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792920/extras/159a6128c814184e551919c7b15efebe.webm?t=1752675533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792920/extras/159a6128c814184e551919c7b15efebe.mp4?t=1752675533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic fantasy adventure in Mythswayer, a turn-based rogue-lite where every run is a new challenge through magical tomes filled with danger, secrets, and powerful discoveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792920/extras/33859fe9c1acb06d20d3a795aa162fbf.poster.avif?t=1752675533\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792920/extras/33859fe9c1acb06d20d3a795aa162fbf.webm?t=1752675533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792920/extras/33859fe9c1acb06d20d3a795aa162fbf.mp4?t=1752675533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle foes based on a complex RPG-lite combat system where your progression choices, items, and strategy all matter. Be wary of your environment, as weather and the time of day also influence the threats you encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792920/extras/20b7cb2ba84ff7fee8367b51ea52d2db.poster.avif?t=1752675533\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792920/extras/20b7cb2ba84ff7fee8367b51ea52d2db.webm?t=1752675533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792920/extras/20b7cb2ba84ff7fee8367b51ea52d2db.mp4?t=1752675533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot your enemies and hidden treasures to acquire meaningful gear items, tomes, and potions of refreshment. Manage your character points and skills to create the hero you want to be in an almost classless progression system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792920/extras/bcc26632aa08f6620e30e3181663d793.poster.avif?t=1752675533\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792920/extras/bcc26632aa08f6620e30e3181663d793.webm?t=1752675533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792920/extras/bcc26632aa08f6620e30e3181663d793.mp4?t=1752675533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your Arcane Tome and magical inks to alter your environment and overcome obstacles, create cover, or trick your foes. Discover new \u201cIdeas\u201d that help you shape the very fabric of reality as you wade through ancient Myths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792920/extras/d1b5727c694b6740c9d8af8f2f8490a4.poster.avif?t=1752675533\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792920/extras/d1b5727c694b6740c9d8af8f2f8490a4.webm?t=1752675533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792920/extras/d1b5727c694b6740c9d8af8f2f8490a4.mp4?t=1752675533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a casual player looking for a fun challenge or a hardcore strategist craving depth, Mythswayer has something for you. If you love tactical combat, rogue-lite challenges, and high-fantasy adventures, get ready to inscribe your legend in Mythswayer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please help us get funded! We need as many wishlists as possible to ensure the future of the game! Many thanks for your support in advance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792920/extras/159a6128c814184e551919c7b15efebe.poster.avif?t=1752675533\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792920/extras/159a6128c814184e551919c7b15efebe.webm?t=1752675533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792920/extras/159a6128c814184e551919c7b15efebe.mp4?t=1752675533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
